<title>USA: U.S. meat output 2.5 pct below a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 2.5 pct below a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, April 5, fell 2.5 at 786.6 million lbs.</p>
<p>-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>05-Apr-97	452.3     6.5	323.0     4.8	786.6</p>
<p>29-Mar-97	451.5     6.5	344.1     4.9	807.0</p>
<p>Change:	    0.2%    0.0%	-6.1%   -2.0%	-2.5%</p>
<p>06-Apr-96	469.7     6.3	332.0     6.4	814.4</p>
<p>Change:	   -3.7%    3.2%	-2.7%  -25.0%	-3.4%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     6353.5    88.2     4398.0    68.7    10908.4</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     6635.1    94.2     4644.7    78.7    11452.7</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.2%   -6.4%	-5.3%  -12.7%     -4.8%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE    CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>05-Apr-97     655,000	   31,000     1,717,000	72,000</p>
<p>29-Mar-97     653,000	   31,000     1,827,000	73,000</p>
<p>Change:	   0.3%	     0.0%	   -6.0%	 -1.4%</p>
<p>06-Apr-96     673,000	   29,000     1,796,000	99,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -2.7%	     6.9%	   -4.4%	-27.3%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   9,215,000	  420,000    23,386,000   1,042,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  9,399,000	  449,000    25,016,000   1,206,000</p>
<p>Change:	   -2.0%	    -6.3%	   -6.5%	-13.7%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>05-Apr-97    Est    1164	   346	   256	  136</p>
<p>29-Mar-97    Est    1165	   348	   256	  135</p>
<p>06-Apr-96    Actual 1166	   372	   254	  128</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>05-Apr-97    Est     694	   215	   189	   67</p>
<p>29-Mar-97    Est     695	   216	   189	   67</p>
<p>06-Apr-96    Actual  701	   220	   185	   64</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>22-Mar-97    48.5%	  30.6%	18.9%	  2.0%</p>
<p>23-Mar-96    47.7%	  31.2%	19.2%	  2.0%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	     SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>22-Mar-97	 96.1%		     3.2%	  0.7%</p>
<p>23-Mar-96	 95.1%		     4.0%	  0.9%</p>
<p>(1) Previous week estimates may be revised. Year ago data are actuals.</p>
<p>(2) Excludes lard.     (3) Totals may not add due to rounding.</p>
